# name: kiro-service-all
# priority: 1526
# section: ai
# description: Kiro 编程、个人登录与依赖合集
# boundary: 包含Kiro自有入口、1531共用API、官方个人登录与验证码、Stripe计费及插件/Powers依赖；共享主机上的其他应用请求也随本表选路。本组与细分或其他含1531的合集二选一。各应用目录内原1530入口与本组内容相同，保留原订阅覆盖；组织SSO和GovCloud旧Q端点仍在核实。
# created-at: 2026-11-27T03:04:23Z
# updated-at: 2026-11-27T03:04:23Z
# rule-count: 11
# source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VPSDance/ai-proxy-rules/main/rules/loon/kiro.list
# source: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazonq/latest/qdeveloper-ug/firewall.md
# source: https://kiro.dev/docs/privacy-and-security/firewalls/
# source: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazonq/latest/qdeveloper-ug/q-admin-setup-subscribe-regions.md
# source: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazonq/latest/qdeveloper-ug/regions.md
# source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/boto/botocore/develop/botocore/data/endpoints.json

DOMAIN,q.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com
DOMAIN,q.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,kiro.dev
DOMAIN,cognito-identity.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.awswaf.com
DOMAIN,billing.stripe.com
DOMAIN,checkout.stripe.com
DOMAIN,github.com
DOMAIN,open-vsx.org
DOMAIN,openvsx.eclipsecontent.org
DOMAIN,raw.githubusercontent.com
